  "description": "Experimental gate for AgentMemory for .NET: a judge at the fan-in that decides, memory by memory, what a recall puts in front of the assistant, and a judge on the write path that decides what a new memory replaces. Speaks the System One decision protocol (online or local). Opt-in; every public type is marked [Experimental(\"AMGATE001\")] while the contracts settle.",
